<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (As we studied more deeply, we realised that yoga is much more than flexibility or physical exercise. It is a discipline that helps us understand the body, regulate the mind, cultivate awareness, and live with greater clarity and balance. The more we learnt, the more we felt a responsibility to share this knowledge in a way that is authentic, practical, and relevant to modern life.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Over the years, we have had the privilege of teaching students from diverse backgrounds, conducting workshops, retreats, corporate wellness programs, and collaborating with government organisations. Yet, even today, we continue to consider ourselves students first. Yoga is a lifelong journey of learning, observation, and practice.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
