/T (A yoga certification is not limited to a job. It can become the foundation of an independent practice or entrepreneurial journey. Many yoga professionals choose to build their own communities, create courses, conduct retreats, and expand their reach through digital platforms. Whether you wish to teach part-time alongside your current profession or pursue yoga as a full-time career, the opportunities are diverse and continue to evolve with the growing wellness industry. Your certification is the beginning. Your vision, consistency, and creativity determine how far you grow.)
